WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:23.136
"This is bad!" Eddy said.

2
00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:30.100
"I can't drive!"

3
00:00:30.101 --> 00:00:36.768
"Me neither!" Dipper cried.

4
00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:41.363
"What will we do?"

5
00:00:41.364 --> 00:00:48.328
Ms. Fender came over.

6
00:00:48.329 --> 00:00:55.832
She gasped. "Water is not for cars!"

7
00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.587
"We're sorry!" Dipper said.

8
00:00:58.588 --> 00:01:01.386
"Now we're stuck!"

9
00:01:01.387 --> 00:01:06.187
Ms. Fender sighed.

10
00:01:06.188 --> 00:01:11.847
"I'll get help," she said.

11
00:01:11.848 --> 00:01:17.925
A small boat arrived.

12
00:01:17.926 --> 00:01:24.023
"I'm Toots," she said.

13
00:01:24.024 --> 00:01:35.336
Toots pushed everyone onto the sand.

14
00:01:35.337 --> 00:01:41.455
"Stay on land," Toots said.

15
00:01:41.456 --> 00:01:46.103
"Water is not for cars."

16
00:01:46.104 --> 00:01:50.173
The cars still couldn't drive.

17
00:01:50.174 --> 00:01:56.219
"Your engines are wet," Ms. Fender said.

18
00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.713
"The sun will dry them."

19
00:02:00.714 --> 00:02:08.709
Soon Eddy's engine was dry.

20
00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:14.431
The others could drive too.

21
00:02:14.432 --> 00:02:22.606
Everyone drove back to school.

22
00:02:22.607 --> 00:02:27.230
"What did you learn today?" Ms. Fender asked.

23
00:02:27.231 --> 00:02:30.579
"Water is fun," Dipper said.

24
00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:37.816
"But it is not for cars!"
